      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Charge of Payment on Account of\nInsufficient Funds. Pursuant to section 85 of the General\nMunicipal Law, a charge of fifteen dollars per check may be\nadded to any account owing to the city of New York or any\nof its agencies where a tendered payment of such account was\nby a check or other written order that was returned for\ninsufficient funds.",
